# Hollow Crown Platform (this repo)

## Stack load order

`HC-Foundation` → `HollowCrownHub` → minigame plugin(s).

## Where to edit

| Task | Location |
|------|----------|
| Shared API / SPI | `api/src/main/java/com/hollowcrown/api/` |
| Hub lobbies, queue, parties | `hub/src/main/java/com/hollowcrown/hub/` |
| Iron Legacy match logic | `minigames/iron-legacy/` |
| New minigame | `minigames/<id>/` + root `pom.xml` module |

## Integration

- Minigames register `MinigameMechanic` on `GamePlatform` via `MinigameBootstrap`.
- Hub owns `templates.yml`, lobby worlds (`*-L#`), `MatchQueueService`, `PreMatchLimboService`.
- Do not add `depend` on minigames in Hub; integration is Bukkit services + mechanics.
